\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Source: BOJ Will Keep Easy Conditions During  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 144 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 02:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  'will keep providing ample liquidity, along with yen funds injected via \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' a person familiar with the bank's thinking told Dow Jones Newswires Friday, suggesting that the bank is likely to leave the coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilized.\par \par \uc2 'Since the bank has already supplied plenty of funds, it would be difficult to distinguish which money is increased via \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but (the bank's stance to keep providing liquidity) could consequently make' \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilized, the person added.\par \par \uc2 The Group of Seven finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors Friday morning expressed solidarity with \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and pledged to jointly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to ensure orderly markets. -By Megumi Fujikawa, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-6269-2786; megumi.fujikawa@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -0-\par \par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011 \uc2 Dow Jones & Company, Inc\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020110318e73i0018i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
